# 04. Architectural Boundary

The API must sit between the user interface and domain logic.

The frontend must never directly access:

```text
database
ORM
database credentials
internal service credentials
event broker
private infrastructure
```

The frontend communicates through approved application contracts.

---

# 05. API Style

AEGIS will use a **resource-oriented HTTP API with explicit domain commands**.

This means the API supports two major interaction categories.

## Queries

Retrieve information.

```text
GET
```

## Commands

Request consequential state changes.

```text
POST
```

The distinction is conceptual even when both ultimately interact with persistence.

---

