# 08. Service Architecture

AEGIS should **not** begin as a collection of independent microservices.

That would introduce unnecessary distributed-system complexity before the product has validated its domain.

The preferred initial architecture is:

```text
                    AEGIS API
                       │
       ┌───────────────┼───────────────┐
       ↓               ↓               ↓
 Application       Domain          Query
 Services          Services        Services
       │               │               │
       └───────────────┼───────────────┘
                       ↓
                  Persistence
                       ↓
                  Event System
```

These are logical service boundaries.

They do not require separate deployable services during the first implementation.

