# 81. Cross-Screen Data Consistency

If a threat changes from:

```text
UNDER_REVIEW
```

to:

```text
CHARACTERIZED
```

then all screens displaying that threat must eventually converge on:

```text
CHARACTERIZED
```

The system must not allow:

```text
Threat Overview = CHARACTERIZED

Executive = UNDER_REVIEW

Investigation = UNDER_REVIEW
```

indefinitely because each screen maintains independent fake state.

