# 111. Master API Invariants

AEGIS API must satisfy:

### Invariant 01

Every consequential state change is authorized.

### Invariant 02

Every consequential state change follows the domain state machine.

### Invariant 03

Every consequential state change produces appropriate history.

### Invariant 04

Every important domain change can produce a domain event.

### Invariant 05

Duplicate consequential commands cannot accidentally duplicate effects.

### Invariant 06

Stale clients cannot silently overwrite newer state.

### Invariant 07

Frontend restrictions are never the only enforcement layer.

### Invariant 08

Evidence and interpretation remain distinct.

### Invariant 09

API responses do not become accidental sources of contradictory truth.

### Invariant 10

AI agents cannot silently redefine the API.

