# 114. Definition of Done

Document 07 is considered complete when engineering can determine, for every consequential user interaction:

```text
Which command is issued?
Which endpoint receives it?
Who is authorized?
What validation occurs?
Which domain service executes it?
Which state transition occurs?
Which data changes?
Which audit record is created?
Which domain event is emitted?
Which screens receive the update?
What happens if the operation fails?
What happens if the client retries?
What happens if another user changed the entity first?
```

If those questions cannot be answered, the implementation architecture is incomplete.

